<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="426501184"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1556788462"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="ぼうやの夢よ"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="高橋李依"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TVアニメ「Re：ゼロから始める異世界生活」後期エンディングテーマ「Stay Alive」 歌：エミリア（CV：高橋李依）"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:29.248"><div begin="00:07.378" end="03:14.057"><p begin="00:07.378" end="00:13.246" itunes:key="L1">小さな人の子よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小小的孩子啊 迷失在森林深处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi i sa na hi to no ko yo mo ri he ma yo i ko n da</span></p><p begin="00:13.358" end="00:20.435" itunes:key="L2">森へ迷い込んだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一不小心在森林中迷失了方向</span></p><p begin="00:21.013" end="00:26.810" itunes:key="L3">大きなこの羽が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这双巨大的翅膀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o o ki na ko no ha ne ga</span></p><p begin="00:26.983" end="00:33.952" itunes:key="L4">ぼうやは見えないのね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小男孩却看不见呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo u ya ha mi e na i no ne</span></p><p begin="00:34.592" end="00:40.724" itunes:key="L5">なにも知らない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一无所知的圆润脸颊呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo shi ra na i ma a ru i ho 'p pe yo</span></p><p begin="00:41.051" end="00:46.889" itunes:key="L6">まあるいほっぺよ</p><p begin="00:48.243" end="00:54.423" itunes:key="L7">ねむれやねむれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睡吧睡吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mu re ya ne mu re</span></p><p begin="00:54.949" end="01:01.454" itunes:key="L8">しずかな水辺においで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来到静谧的水边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi zu ka na mi zu be ni o i de</span></p><p begin="01:01.776" end="01:08.227" itunes:key="L9">ぼうやの夢は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小男孩的梦 乘着龙背飘向远方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo u ya no yu me ha ryu u no se ni ha ko ba re te</span></p><p begin="01:08.585" end="01:14.912" itunes:key="L10">竜の背に運ばれて</p><p begin="01:15.424" end="01:21.607" itunes:key="L11">山の向こうへ消える<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消失在山的彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ma no mu ko u he ki e ru</span></p><p begin="01:39.309" end="01:45.520" itunes:key="L12">よろずの子らも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">万千孩童们 并排沉入梦乡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ro zu no ko ra mo na ra n de ne mu ru</span></p><p begin="01:46.114" end="01:51.889" itunes:key="L13">ならんでねむる</p><p begin="01:52.900" end="01:59.067" itunes:key="L14">七つ数えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">数到第七声 便和睦地安然入睡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na na tsu ka zo e ta ra na ka yo ku ne mu 't te ku</span></p><p begin="01:59.255" end="02:06.632" itunes:key="L15">仲良くねむってく</p><p begin="02:11.636" end="02:17.414" itunes:key="L16">なにも見えない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看不见一切的稚嫩眼眸呀</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na ni mo mi e na i chi i sa na o me me yo</span></p><p begin="02:18.011" end="02:23.797" itunes:key="L17">小さなおめめよ</p><p begin="02:25.221" end="02:31.340" itunes:key="L18">ねむれやねむれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睡吧睡吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mu re ya ne mu re</span></p><p begin="02:32.032" end="02:38.409" itunes:key="L19">そよぐ草むらへおいで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">踏入轻摇的草丛深处</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so yo gu ku sa mu ra he o i de</span></p><p begin="02:38.872" end="02:46.108" itunes:key="L20">ぼうやの夢は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小男孩的梦 寻觅着妈妈的身影</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo u ya no yu me ha ka a sa n wo sa ga shi te ha</span></p><p begin="02:47.359" end="02:53.537" itunes:key="L21">母さんを探しては</p><p begin="02:54.159" end="03:00.247" itunes:key="L22">空の向こうへ帰る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向着天空的彼端归去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra no mu ko u he ka e ru</span></p><p begin="03:00.984" end="03:07.167" itunes:key="L23">竜の背に運ばれて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">乘着龙背飘向远方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ryu u no se ni ha ko ba re te</span></p><p begin="03:07.770" end="03:14.057" itunes:key="L24">山の向こうへ消える<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">消失在山的彼端</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ma no mu ko u he ki e ru</span></p></div></body></tt>